models
  Claude CLI Opus: claude-opus-4-7 via Claude CLI (claude-cli) bypass=off
    argv: --no-chrome
    env: CLAUDE_CODE_DISABLE_AUTO_MEMORY, CLAUDE_CODE_MAX_OUTPUT_TOKENS
  Codex CLI: codex-cli via Codex CLI (codex-cli) bypass=on
